{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-15-1","title":"Proverbs 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>25:15; Jud 8:1-3; 1Sa 25:21-33 grievous 18; 10:12; 28:25; 29:22; Jud 12:3-6; 1Sa 25:10,11,21,22; 2Sa 19:43 1Ki 12:13-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-2","title":"Proverbs 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>tongue. 23,28; 12:23; 13:16; 16:23; 25:11,12; Ps 45:1; Ec 10:12,13; Isa 50:4 poureth. Heb. belcheth, or, bubbleth. Ps 59:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-3","title":"Proverbs 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>5:21; 2Ch 16:9; Job 34:21,22; Jer 16:17; 23:24; 32:19; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-4","title":"Proverbs 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>A wholesome. Heb. The healing of the. 12:18; 16:24; Mal 4:2 a tree. 3:18; Ge 3:22-24; 1Ti 6:3; Re 2:7 a breach. 18:8,14; 26:22; Ps 52:2-4; 109:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-5","title":"Proverbs 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>fool. 10:1; 13:1,18; 1Sa 2:23-25; 2Sa 15:1-6; 1Ch 22:11-13; 28:9,20 but. 31,32; 1:23; 6:23; 19:20; 25:12; Ps 141:5; Tit 1:13; 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-6","title":"Proverbs 15:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the house. 16; 8:21; 13:22; 21:20; Ps 112:3; Heb 11:26 in the revenues. 10:22; 16:8; Job 20:19-23; Ps 37:16; Ec 4:6; 5:10-14; Jas 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-7","title":"Proverbs 15:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>lips. Ps 37:30; 45:2; 51:13-15; 71:15-18; 78:2-6; 119:13; Ec 12:9,10 So 4:11; Mt 10:27; 28:18-20; Mr 16:15; Ac 18:9,10; Ro 10:14-17 Ro 15:18-21; Eph 4:29; 2Ti 2:2 the heart. 10:20,21; Mt 12:34; Jas 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-8","title":"Proverbs 15:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>sacrifice. 21:27; 28:9; Isa 1:10-15; 61:8; 66:3; Jer 6:20; 7:21-23; Am 5:21,22 Joh 4:24 the prayer. 29; 1Ch 29:17; Ps 17:1; So 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-9","title":"Proverbs 15:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>The way. 4:19; 21:4,8; Ps 1:6; 146:8,9; Mt 7:13; Jer 44:4; Hab 1:13 he loveth. 21:21; Isa 26:7; 51:1,7; Ho 6:3; 1Ti 6:11; 2Ti 2:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-10","title":"Proverbs 15:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Correction. or, Instruction. grievous. 12:1; 13:1; 23:35; 1Ki 18:17; 21:20; 22:8; Joh 3:20; 7:7 and he. 1:30; 5:12; 10:17; Isa 1:5,6; Eze 24:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-11","title":"Proverbs 15:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Hell. 27:20; Job 26:6; Ps 139:8; Re 1:18 the hearts. 2Ch 6:30; Ps 7:9; 44:21; Jer 17:10; Joh 2:24,25; 21:17; Heb 4:13 Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-12","title":"Proverbs 15:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>scorner. 10; 9:7,8; Am 5:10; Joh 3:18-21; 7:7; 2Ti 4:3 neither. 2Ch 18:7; Job 21:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-13","title":"Proverbs 15:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>merry. 15; 17:22; 2Co 1:12 by. 12:25; 18:14; Ne 2:2; Joh 14:1; 2Co 2:7; 7:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-14","title":"Proverbs 15:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>heart. 1:5; 9:9; 1Ki 3:6-12; Ps 119:97,100; Ac 17:11; 2Pe 3:18 the mouth. 12:23; Isa 30:10; 44:20; Ho 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-15","title":"Proverbs 15:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>All. Ge 37:35; 47:9; Ps 90:7-9 but. 16:22; 17:22; Ac 16:25; Ro 5:2,3,11; 12:12; 2Co 1:5,12; 6:10 1Pe 1:6-8; 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-16","title":"Proverbs 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>little. 16:8; 28:6; Ps 37:16; 1Ti 6:6 great. 10:22; Ec 2:10,11,18-23; 5:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-17","title":"Proverbs 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>17:1; 21:19; Ps 133:1-3; Php 2:1; 1Jo 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-18","title":"Proverbs 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>wrathful. 10:12; 26:21; 28:25; 29:22; 2Sa 19:43; 20:1; Jas 3:14-16 he. 1; 25:15; Ge 13:8,9; Jud 8:1-3; 1Sa 25:24-44; Ec 10:4; Mt 5:9 Ac 6:1-5; Jas 1:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-19","title":"Proverbs 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>way of the slothful. 22:5,13; 26:13; Nu 14:1-3,7-9 the way of the righteous. 3:6; 8:9; Ps 5:8; 25:8,9,12; 27:11; Isa 30:21; 35:8 made plain. Heb. raised up as a causey. Isa 57:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-20","title":"Proverbs 15:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>wise. 10:1; 23:15,16; 29:3; 1Ki 1:48; 2:9; 5:7; Php 2:22 despiseth. 23:22; 30:17; Ex 20:12; Le 19:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-21","title":"Proverbs 15:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>joy. 10:23; 14:9; 26:18,19 destitute of wisdom. Heb. void of heart. 11:12; *marg: a man. 14:16; Job 28:28; Ps 111:10; Eph 5:15; Jas 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-22","title":"Proverbs 15:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>11:14; 20:18; Ec 8:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-23","title":"Proverbs 15:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>joy. 12:14; 16:13; 24:26; 25:11,12; Eph 4:29 in due season. Heb. in his season. Ec 3:1; Isa 50:4 how. 1Sa 25:32,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-24","title":"Proverbs 15:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>way. 6:23; Ps 16:11; 139:24; Jer 21:8; Mt 7:14; Joh 14:6 above. Php 3:20; Col 3:1,2 that. 2:18; 5:5; 7:27; 9:8; 23:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-25","title":"Proverbs 15:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>destroy. 12:7; 14:11; Job 40:11-13; Ps 52:1,5; 138:6; Isa 2:12; Da 5:20 1Pe 5:5 but. De 10:17,18; Ps 68:5,6; 146:9; Jas 1:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-26","title":"Proverbs 15:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>thoughts. 6:16-19; 24:9; Jer 4:14; Mt 15:19 but. 23; Ps 19:14; 37:30,31; 45:1; Mt 12:34-37 pleasant words. Heb. words of pleasantness.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-27","title":"Proverbs 15:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>He that is. 1:19; 11:19,29; 20:21; De 7:26; Jos 6:18; 7:11,12,24,25; 1Sa 8:3-5 2Ki 5:27; Isa 5:8-10; Jer 17:11; Hab 2:9-11; Zec 5:3,4 but. 28:16; 29:4; Ex 18:21; 23:8; De 16:19; Isa 33:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-28","title":"Proverbs 15:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>heart. 2; 16:23; 1Ki 3:23-28; Ec 5:2,6; 1Pe 3:15 the mouth. 10:19; 13:16; 29:11,20; Ec 10:12-14; Mt 12:34; Tit 1:10,11 Jas 3:6-8; 2Pe 2:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-29","title":"Proverbs 15:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>far. Ps 10:1; 34:16; 73:27; 138:6; Mt 25:46; Eph 2:12,13 he heareth. 8; Ps 34:15-17; 66:18,19; 145:18,19; Isa 55:8,9; Joh 9:31 Ro 8:26,27; Jas 5:16-18; 1Pe 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-30","title":"Proverbs 15:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>light. 13:9; Ezr 9:8; Ec 11:7; Re 21:23; 22:5 a good. 17:22; 25:25; Ps 89:15; Lu 2:10-19 the bones. 3:8; Isa 58:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-31","title":"Proverbs 15:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>ear. 5; 1:23; 9:8,9; 13:20; 19:20; 25:12; Isa 55:3 abideth. Joh 15:3,4; 1Jo 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-32","title":"Proverbs 15:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>refuseth. 1:24-33; 5:11,12; 8:33-36; Ps 50:17; Heb 12:15 instruction. or, correction. 29:1; Isa 1:5; Jer 5:3; Eze 24:13,14 heareth. or, obeyeth. 5:13; De 21:18,20; Mt 7:24-27; Jas 1:22; Re 3:19 getteth understanding. Heb. possesseth an heart. 14,21; *marg: 17:16; 18:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-15-33","title":"Proverbs 15:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>fear. 1:7; 8:13; Job 28:28; Ps 34:11; 111:10 and. 18:12; 25:6,7; 29:23; Lu 14:11; Php 2:5-11; Jas 4:10; 1Pe 5:5</p>"}]}